          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I had always wanted to see a bear catch a fish."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Her grandson also thought it was a great chance to relax."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "That weekend, Joy climbed her first mountain with Brad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "They also learned how to take beautiful photos of the stars."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Until 2015, she had hardly left her small town in Ohio, U.S.A."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "F",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The two are looking forward to the day they visit their final park!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "G",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "So they set a big goal—to visit all 63 national parks in the country together."
            }
          ]
        }
